: "I paid Evergreen Catering's approved invoice INV-49004 in full by wire.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Amount:** $2,969.92 USD\n- **Rail:** Wire (ACH was not needed)\n- **Status:** Sent\n\nThe amount is under the $10,000 controller-approval threshold, so no extra approval was needed. I sent the payment once, using an idempotency key so it cannot be executed twice. I did not touch the vendor's other invoices: INV-23798 is already paid, and INV-79479 is still a draft awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}